h the user's profile using Playwright. The user's Edge profile should have the login cookies.\n\nActually, let me try to launch Edge with remote debugging port first, then connect via Playwright.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Let me check if we can use the old API at developer.toutiao.com to create a game, since that's the domain tma cookies work for.\n\nLet me try using curl with the tma cookies to access the developer API.\n\nActually, let me just try the straightforward approach - write a Node.js script using Playwright to:\n1. Launch Edge with the user's profile\n2. Navigate to developer.open-douyin.com\n3. Create the game\n\nLet me check the Edge user data directory first.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"bdf2e026-996f-4379-9628-85eda3e7b833"}
