{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240046403e5d1117eeeb4116","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the developer console is loaded. I can see:- There's a \"创建小游戏\" (Create Mini-Game) button- There's already one game: 消消消大作战 (AppID: tte7a1911c79c6fc8302)- The user is logged in as \"uunderli...\" / \"周鼎诺\" (超级管理员)- 已创建1/5 (1/5 created)\n\nNow I need to click the \"创建小游戏\" button to create a new game. Let me write a script that:\n1. Clicks the \"创建小游戏\" button\n2. Fills in the form with the game name \"成语闯关大师\"\n3. Selects the category (益智/闯关)\n4. Submits the form\n5. Gets the new AppID\n\nLet me also set up network interception to capture the API calls.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"ff6931e0-984f-4e4f-898c-4e3810ab55de"}
