{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_031b07ff61494a00b5dd78a7","type":"tool_result","content":"Trying name: 鼎诺成语闯关\nResult: 应用开发\n能力直达\n文档站\n学堂与社区\n开发者支持\n服务生态\n控制台\n2\nuunderli...\n控制台\n创建小游戏\n小游戏名称\n1. 名称支持大小写字母、数字和中文，字符长度4-30，一个汉字算两个字符\n2. 建议小游戏名称和软著等资质文件等级名称保持一致，否则可能无法进行备案、广告投放等。查看详细命名规则。\n联系人姓名\n联系人电话\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n联系人邮箱\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n小游戏预计使用开发引擎\n普通小游戏引擎(Cocos/Laya/Egret/Godot/其他)\n请选择该款小游戏预计使用的开发引擎，后续开发时可随时更改「引擎切换指引」\n我已阅读并同意\n《小游戏开发者平台服务协议》\n、\n《小游戏开发者平台信息保护声明》\n创建\n更多说明\n关于修改\n\n1.\n\n \n\n正式上架前，名称可保留 30 天，如未及时发布版本，名称会被释放。（释放名称其他用户可抢占）\n\n2. 正式上架后，每个自然年可修改 2 次。\n\n关于审核\n\n1.\n\n \n\n名称仅支持使用中文、数字、及英文，不能使用特殊符号、繁体字、生僻字、拆字或颜文字；","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"dd840627-db61-4733-8d5b-db0e140fbbcd","timestamp":"2026-05-23T16:51:24.589Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"Trying name: 鼎诺成语闯关\nResult: 应用开发\n能力直达\n文档站\n学堂与社区\n开发者支持\n服务生态\n控制台\n2\nuunderli...\n控制台\n创建小游戏\n小游戏名称\n1. 名称支持大小写字母、数字和中文，字符长度4-30，一个汉字算两个字符\n2. 建议小游戏名称和软著等资质文件等级名称保持一致，否则可能无法进行备案、广告投放等。查看详细命名规则。\n联系人姓名\n联系人电话\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n联系人邮箱\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n小游戏预计使用开发引擎\n普通小游戏引擎(Cocos/Laya/Egret/Godot/其他)\n请选择该款小游戏预计使用的开发引擎，后续开发时可随时更改「引擎切换指引」\n我已阅读并同意\n《小游戏开发者平台服务协议》\n、\n《小游戏开发者平台信息保护声明》\n创建\n更多说明\n关于修改\n\n1.\n\n \n\n正式上架前，名称可保留 30 天，如未及时发布版本，名称会被释放。（释放名称其他用户可抢占）\n\n2. 正式上架后，每个自然年可修改 2 次。\n\n关于审核\n\n1.\n\n \n\n名称仅支持使用中文、数字、及英文，不能使用特殊符号、繁体字、生僻字、拆字或颜文字；","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524005126f2eb57d194cd4d0e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems like \"鼎诺成语闯关\" went through without the \"名称已存在\" error. But the page is still on the same form. Let me check if the form actually submitted or if there's an issue.\n\nWait, looking at the result more carefully:\n- The form fields are now empty (no values shown in the text)\n- No error message like \"名称已存在\"\n- But no success message either\n- The page is still on `console/apply/game`\n\nThis could mean:\n1. The form submitted but there was an error not shown in text\n2. The form didn't actually submit (checkbox might not have been checked properly)\n3. The form submitted and we need to check a different page\n\nLet me check the screenshot to see what happened. But I can't view screenshots. Let me try a more careful approach - check the actual network request that was made.\n\nActually, looking at the output, there's no \"CREATE API\" log, which means the create API was not called. This suggests the form didn't actually submit. The checkbox might not have been checked properly, or the button click didn't work.\n\nLet me try a different approach:\n1. First check the checkbox properly\n2. Then verify all fields are filled\n3. Then click the create button via evaluate\n4. Monitor the network requests more carefully\n\nAlso, I notice the fields appear empty in the text extraction, but the Playwright fill() should have set them. The issue might be that the form values aren't reflected in the body text because Semi Design components render differently.\n\nLet me try using page.fill() with proper selectors instead of evaluate.\n\nActually, let me try a completely different approach - submit the form directly via the API. I already have the open-douyin.com cookies. Let me find the correct API endpoint by monitoring network traffic when I submit.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"e58f460b-e1fe-4534-b888-46fe0b209e4a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524005126f2eb57d194cd4d0e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_ef63dbda72ee449eb5bab004","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/fill_form7.cjs << 'SCRIPT'\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.connectOverCDP('http://127.0.0.1:9222');\n  const context = browser.contexts()[0];\n  \n  // Monitor ALL requests during submission\n  context.on('request', req => {\n    if (req.method() === 'POST' && req.url().includes('open-douyin')) {\n      console.log(`REQ: ${req.method()} ${req.url()}`);\n      if (req.postData()) console.log(`  Body: ${req.postData().substring(0, 300)}`);\n    }\n  });\n  context.on('response', async res => {\n    if (res.url().includes('open-douyin') && res.request().method() === 'POST') {\n      try {\n        console.log(`RES: ${res.status()} ${res.url()}`);\n        console.log(`  Body: ${(await res.text()).substring(0, 300)}`);\n      } catch(e) {}\n    }\n  });\n  \n  const pages = context.pages();\n  let page = pages.find(p => p.url().includes('console/apply/game'));\n  if (!page) {\n    page = await context.newPage();\n    await page.goto('https://developer.open-douyin.com/console/apply/game', {\n      waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded', timeout: 30000\n    });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(5000);\n  }\n  \n  // Fill using locator.click + keyboard for React compatibility\n  console.log('Filling form with click+type...');\n  \n  const inputs = await page.locator('input[type=\"text\"]').all();\n  \n  // Name\n  await inputs[0].click();\n  await page.keyboard().press('Control+a');\n  await page.keyboard().type('鼎诺成语闯关', { delay: 50 });\n  console.log('1. Name typed');\n  \n  // Contact\n  await inputs[1].click();\n  await page.keyboard().press('Control+a');\n  await page.keyboard().type('周鼎诺', { delay: 50 });\n  console.log('2. Contact typed');\n  \n  // Phone\n  await inputs[2].click();\n  await page.keyboard().press('Control+a');\n  await page.keyboard().type('18108431035', { delay: 50 });\n  console.log('3. Phone typed');\n  \n  // Email\n  await inputs[3].click();\n  await page.keyboard().press('Control+a');\n  await page.keyboard().type('1163155015@qq.com', { delay: 50 });\n  console.log('4. Email typed');\n  \n  // Engine select\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const selects = document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-select');\n    for (const sel of selects) {\n      if (sel.textContent.trim() === '请选择' && sel.className.includes('w-60')) {\n        sel.click();\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const options = document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-select-option');\n    for (const opt of options) {\n      if (opt.textContent.includes('普通小游戏引擎')) {\n        opt.click();\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  console.log('5. Engine selected');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  \n  // Checkbox - try multiple approaches\n  console.log('6. Checking agreement...');\n  \n  // First try clicking via locator\n  try {\n    const cb = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-checkbox-inner-display').first();\n    await cb.click({ force: true, timeout: 5000 });\n    console.log('  Clicked inner display');\n  } catch(e) {\n    console.log('  Inner display click failed, trying wrapper...');\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\n      document.querySelector('.semi-dy-open-checkbox')?.click();\n    });\n  }\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  \n  // Verify checkbox\n  const isChecked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n  console.log('  Checkbox checked:', isChecked);\n  \n  if (!isChecked) {\n    // Force check via JS\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const input = document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]');\n      if (input) {\n        const nativeInputValueSetter = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(window.HTMLInputElement.prototype, 'checked').set;\n        nativeInputValueSetter.call(input, true);\n        input.dispatchEvent(new Event('change', { bubbles: true }));\n      }\n    });\n    console.log('  Force checked via JS');\n  }\n  \n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/form_ready2.png', fullPage: true });\n  \n  // Submit via button click\n  console.log('7. Submitting...');\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('button');\n    for (const btn of buttons) {\n      if (btn.textContent.trim() === '创建') {\n        console.log('Found create button, clicking...');\n        btn.click();\n        return;\n      }\n    }\n    console.log('Create button not found!');\n  });\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(12000);\n  \n  console.log('\\nFinal URL:', page.url());\n  const text = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 2000));\n  console.log('Final text:', text.substring(0, 800));\n  \n  const appIdMatch = text.match(/tte[a-z0-9]{10,}/);\n  if (appIdMatch) console.log('\\n*** APPID:', appIdMatch[0], '***');\n  \n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/final_result.png', fullPage: true });\n  await browser.close();\n})();\nSCRIPT\nNODE_PATH=\"C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Roaming/npm/node_modules\" node /tmp/fill_form7.cjs 2>&1","description":"Fill form with keyboard typing and monitored requests","timeout":180000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"6262427a-b839-4377-8238-cf0af8dcac4e"}
