{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240055418f401233aa4c4dca","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still no API call was made. The checkbox is checked, the React onClick was called on the button, but no POST request was made to create the app. This suggests the React state is not properly synced - the button's onClick handler probably checks the React component state (not the DOM), and the state still has empty values.\n\nLet me try a completely different approach:\n1. Use Playwright's built-in methods (fill, check) on a fresh page load\n2. Or try to directly use the browser's DevTools protocol to interact with the React components\n\nActually, the core problem is that I'm setting DOM values but React's internal state (which is what the onClick handler reads) is not updated. When I call `input[reactKey].onChange(...)`, it should update React state. But I'm not seeing any network request.\n\nWait - let me check if maybe the React onClick handler is checking for form validation before making the API call. Perhaps the engine selection wasn't properly reflected in React state either.\n\nLet me try a completely fresh approach - use Playwright's native interactions (fill, click, etc.) which should properly trigger all React event handlers. The issue might be that I'm mixing evaluate with Playwright actions.\n\nLet me try:\n1. Navigate to a fresh page\n2. Use ONLY Playwright locator.fill() for inputs (not evaluate)\n3. Use locator.click() for selects and checkbox\n4. Use locator.click() for the submit button\n\nThe key difference is to use Playwright's actionability checks which should properly interact with React components.\n\nActually, let me look at this from a different angle. The form might require the agreement text to be loaded first. Let me check if there's a dialog or popup.\n\nActually, let me try yet another approach: reload the page, then use Playwright fill() which uses keyboard events. That's the most reliable way to interact with React forms.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"12262381-9592-4d2c-81c4-641e4efecde2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240055418f401233aa4c4dca","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_f4f2fc6879094b6db21f7a57","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/create_fresh.cjs << 'SCRIPT'\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.connectOverCDP('http://127.0.0.1:9222');\n  const context = browser.contexts()[0];\n  \n  // Track all network requests\n  page_on_response: {\n    context.on('response', async res => {\n      const url = res.url();\n      if (res.request().method() === 'POST' && url.includes('open-douyin') && !url.includes('monitor') && !url.includes('collect') && !url.includes('channel') && !url.includes('tcc') && !url.includes('GetDictHighlight') && !url.includes('checkFeelGood')) {\n        try {\n          const body = await res.text();\n          if (body.length < 500) console.log(`RES: ${url.split('/').pop()} -> ${body.substring(0, 200)}`);\n        } catch(e) {}\n      }\n    });\n  }\n  \n  // Open fresh page\n  const page = await context.newPage();\n  await page.goto('https://developer.open-douyin.com/console/apply/game', {\n    waitUntil: 'networkidle', timeout: 60000\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(3000);\n  \n  console.log('Page loaded, URL:', page.url());\n  \n  // Use Playwright fill() - this simulates user typing and should work with React\n  const nameInput = page.getByPlaceholder('请输入').first();\n  await nameInput.click();\n  await nameInput.fill('鼎诺成语闯关');\n  console.log('1. Name filled');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  \n  // Get all placeholder inputs\n  const allInputs = page.getByPlaceholder('请输入');\n  const count = await allInputs.count();\n  console.log('Total placeholder inputs:', count);\n  \n  // Fill each one\n  const vals = ['鼎诺成语闯关', '周鼎诺', '18108431035', '1163155015@qq.com'];\n  for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(count, 4); i++) {\n    await allInputs.nth(i).fill(vals[i]);\n    await page.waitForTimeout(100);\n  }\n  console.log('2-4. All inputs filled');\n  \n  // Verify\n  const formVals = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('input[type=\"text\"]')).map(i => i.value);\n  });\n  console.log('Form values:', formVals);\n  \n  // Engine dropdown - find the trigger\n  console.log('5. Engine...');\n  // The dropdown trigger should be findable by its placeholder\n  const engineTrigger = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-select').filter({ hasText: '请选择' }).last();\n  await engineTrigger.click({ timeout: 10000 });\n  console.log('  Dropdown clicked');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\n  \n  // Select option\n  const engineOption = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-select-option').filter({ hasText: '普通小游戏引擎' }).first();\n  await engineOption.click({ timeout: 5000 });\n  console.log('  Option selected');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  \n  // Agreement checkbox - find the checkbox input and click its parent label\n  console.log('6. Agreement...');\n  const agreementLabel = page.locator('label, [class*=\"checkbox\"]').filter({ hasText: '我已阅读' }).first();\n  \n  // Try different selectors for the checkbox\n  try {\n    // Click the checkbox via its label text\n    const agreeText = page.getByText('我已阅读并同意');\n    await agreeText.click({ timeout: 5000 });\n    console.log('  Clicked agreement text');\n  } catch(e) {\n    console.log('  Text click failed, trying other approach...');\n    // Click the checkbox outer div\n    await page.locator('.semi-dy-open-checkbox').first().click({ timeout: 5000 });\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  \n  const isAgreed = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n  console.log('  Checkbox checked:', isAgreed);\n  \n  // Take screenshot before submit\n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/pre_submit.png', fullPage: true });\n  \n  // Submit - find the create button specifically (not the header \"创建小游戏\" button)\n  console.log('7. Submit...');\n  const submitBtn = page.locator('button.semi-dy-open-button-primary').filter({ hasText: '创建' }).last();\n  await submitBtn.click({ timeout: 10000 });\n  console.log('  Button clicked');\n  \n  // Wait for result\n  await page.waitForTimeout(15000);\n  \n  console.log('Final URL:', page.url());\n  const result = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 3000));\n  console.log('Result:', result.substring(0, 800));\n  \n  const appIdMatch = result.match(/tte[a-z0-9]{10,}/);\n  if (appIdMatch) console.log('\\n*** SUCCESS! APPID:', appIdMatch[0], '***');\n  \n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/submit_final.png', fullPage: true });\n  await browser.close();\n})();\nSCRIPT\nNODE_PATH=\"C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Roaming/npm/node_modules\" node /tmp/create_fresh.cjs 2>&1","description":"Create game with fresh page and proper Playwright interactions","timeout":180000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"7af3c8f2-5a1d-4b81-9f63-7e86ffe57957"}
