{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524005802e915a2733778436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! The page redirected to `https://developer.open-douyin.com/console?type=1` which is the \"小程序\" (mini-program) tab. It seems like clicking the primary button actually navigated away from the form page instead of submitting it. This might be because the button I clicked was a different button (like a navigation button).\n\nWait, looking at the response, I see `getApplicationList` returned `TotalNum: 0` - this is for mini-programs (ApplicationType=1), not games. And the page shows the mini-program creation page.\n\nSo what happened is:\n1. The form was filled correctly\n2. The checkbox was NOT checked (false)\n3. The submit click navigated away from the form\n\nThe issue is that the button I clicked was probably not the form submit button, but a navigation button. Let me be more specific about which button to click.\n\nLooking at the page more carefully, when I was on the `console/apply/game` page, there's a \"创建\" button in the form. But the page.locator('button.semi-dy-open-button-primary').last() might have matched a different button.\n\nAlso, the checkbox is still not being checked. The addon click didn't work.\n\nLet me take a step back and think about this differently. The key issues are:\n1. The checkbox won't get checked\n2. The wrong button might be getting clicked\n\nLet me try to:\n1. Focus specifically on the checkbox - try all possible approaches\n2. Identify the correct submit button\n\nFor the checkbox, I need to understand why it's not being checked. Semi Design checkboxes use a custom implementation. The checkbox input has `aria-checked=\"false\"`. The checkbox addon is a span with text. Clicking the addon should toggle the checkbox.\n\nLet me try to inspect the checkbox more carefully and find the right click target.\n\nActually, looking at this from a completely different angle - maybe I should try to just reload the create game page, and use the simplest possible approach. The fill() method should work with React if Playwright simulates proper keyboard events.\n\nLet me try ONE MORE TIME with a very focused approach. I'll:\n1. Navigate to the form page\n2. Use fill() for inputs (this should work)\n3. For the checkbox, I'll try clicking the inner checkbox span\n4. For the button, I'll find it by exact text match\n\nActually, let me look at this issue differently. The redirect to console?type=1 suggests the page navigated. Maybe the form was submitted but the game was created and the page redirected. But the app list shows only 1 game (the old one).\n\nWait - the app list query was for ApplicationType=2 (games) and returned TotalNum:1, so only the old game exists. The form didn't create a new game.\n\nOK let me try one more approach - I'll be very explicit about the button.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"3faf248a-0b0f-491b-a976-4f385286fee8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524005802e915a2733778436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"表单仍然失败。让我尝试一种更精确的方法——通过 ID 定位确切的按钮，并使用最精确的复选框处理方法。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"e7e9d1af-2250-40d7-9a1f-911132999b12"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524005802e915a2733778436e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_892029e9142c4965a4a5284a","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/create_final.cjs << 'SCRIPT'\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.connectOverCDP('http://127.0.0.1:9222');\n  const context = browser.contexts()[0];\n  \n  // Monitor game creation specifically\n  context.on('request', req => {\n    if (req.method() === 'POST' && req.url().includes('open-douyin')) {\n      const url = req.url();\n      // Only log potentially relevant requests\n      if (!url.includes('monitor') && !url.includes('collect') && !url.includes('channel') && !url.includes('tcc') && !url.includes('token') && !url.includes('checkFeelGood') && !url.includes('GetDict')) {\n        console.log(`REQ: ${req.method()} ${url.substring(url.indexOf('//') + 2)}`);\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  \n  const page = await context.newPage();\n  await page.goto('https://developer.open-douyin.com/console/apply/game', {\n    waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded', timeout: 30000\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(8000);\n  \n  // Step 1: Fill inputs with Playwright fill()\n  console.log('\\n--- FILLING FORM ---');\n  const textInputs = page.locator('input[type=\"text\"]');\n  const count = await textInputs.count();\n  console.log('Input count:', count);\n  \n  // Fill each input - click first, then type character by character\n  const values = ['鼎诺成语闯关', '周鼎诺', '18108431035', '1163155015@qq.com'];\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n    await textInputs.nth(i).click();\n    await page.waitForTimeout(100);\n    await textInputs.nth(i).fill('');\n    await textInputs.nth(i).type(values[i], { delay: 20 });\n    console.log(`  Input ${i}: ${values[i]}`);\n  }\n  \n  // Step 2: Select engine\n  console.log('\\n--- ENGINE ---');\n  // Click the engine dropdown trigger\n  await page.locator('.semi-dy-open-select-single').click({ timeout: 10000 });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\n  await page.locator('.semi-dy-open-select-option').first().click({ timeout: 5000 });\n  console.log('Engine option selected');\n  \n  // Step 3: Check agreement\n  console.log('\\n--- AGREEMENT ---');\n  \n  // Method: Find and click the actual clickable area of the checkbox\n  // The checkbox has: .semi-dy-open-checkbox (outer) > .semi-dy-open-checkbox-inner > .semi-dy-open-checkbox-inner-display (the visual box)\n  // We need to click the inner-display or the checkbox-addon (label text)\n  \n  // Let's inspect what we have\n  const checkboxInfo = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const cb = document.querySelector('.semi-dy-open-checkbox');\n    if (!cb) return 'no checkbox found';\n    return {\n      outerHTML: cb.outerHTML.substring(0, 500),\n      innerHTML: cb.innerHTML.substring(0, 500),\n      children: Array.from(cb.children).map(c => c.className),\n    };\n  });\n  console.log('Checkbox structure:', JSON.stringify(checkboxInfo, null, 2));\n  \n  // Try clicking the inner checkbox display\n  const innerDisplay = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-checkbox-inner-display').first();\n  if (await innerDisplay.count() > 0) {\n    console.log('Found inner-display, clicking...');\n    // Simulate a real mouse click on the display element\n    const box = await innerDisplay.boundingBox();\n    if (box) {\n      await page.mouse.click(box.x + box.width / 2, box.y + box.height / 2);\n      console.log('Clicked at:', box);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  \n  let checked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n  console.log('Checked after mouse click:', checked);\n  \n  if (!checked) {\n    // Try the addon text\n    console.log('Trying addon text...');\n    const addon = page.locator('#addon-eta1sks, [id^=\"addon\"]').first();\n    if (await addon.count() > 0) {\n      const addonBox = await addon.boundingBox();\n      if (addonBox) {\n        await page.mouse.click(addonBox.x + addonBox.width / 2, addonBox.y + addonBox.height / 2);\n      }\n    } else {\n      // Try clicking the checkbox label by coordinates\n      const cb = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-checkbox').first();\n      const cbBox = await cb.boundingBox();\n      if (cbBox) {\n        await page.mouse.click(cbBox.x + 10, cbBox.y + cbBox.height / 2);\n      }\n    }\n    \n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n    checked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n    console.log('Checked after addon click:', checked);\n  }\n  \n  // Step 4: Submit\n  console.log('\\n--- SUBMIT ---');\n  \n  // Find the correct submit button - it should be in the form area\n  // The page has \"创建小游戏\" in the header and \"创建\" as the submit button\n  // Let me find the submit button by looking at all buttons\n  const btnInfo = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button')).map(b => ({\n      text: b.textContent.trim(),\n      className: b.className.substring(0, 80),\n      disabled: b.disabled,\n      rect: b.getBoundingClientRect().toJSON(),\n    }));\n  });\n  console.log('Buttons:', JSON.stringify(btnInfo.filter(b => b.text.includes('创建')), null, 2));\n  \n  // Click the submit button using mouse coordinates\n  const submitBtn = btnInfo.find(b => b.text === '创建' && !b.disabled);\n  if (submitBtn) {\n    console.log('Clicking submit at:', submitBtn.rect);\n    await page.mouse.click(submitBtn.rect.x + submitBtn.rect.width / 2, submitBtn.rect.y + submitBtn.rect.height / 2);\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(15000);\n  \n  console.log('\\n--- RESULT ---');\n  console.log('URL:', page.url());\n  const text = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 3000));\n  console.log(text.substring(0, 800));\n  \n  const appIdMatch = text.match(/tte[a-z0-9]{10,}/);\n  if (appIdMatch) console.log('\\n*** APPID:', appIdMatch[0], '***');\n  \n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/create_result.png', fullPage: true });\n  await browser.close();\n})();\nSCRIPT\nNODE_PATH=\"C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Roaming/npm/node_modules\" node /tmp/create_final.cjs 2>&1","description":"Final attempt with mouse click for checkbox and submit","timeout":180000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"cb3547ce-03ed-4ad0-9f4e-425aba2715c8"}
