{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524010045e292027a39b84cb9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The useCreateApp hook doesn't directly contain API calls - it likely calls other services. Let me look at the main game creation page bundle more carefully.\n\nLet me try to search for the API endpoint in the page's JavaScript. The form submission handler is likely in a different JS bundle. Let me search more broadly.\n\nActually, let me try a completely different approach. Instead of fighting with the form, let me try to:\n1. Find ALL JS bundles loaded on the page\n2. Search for the API endpoint that creates games\n3. Call it directly from the browser context with the right parameters\n\nOr even simpler - let me monitor network traffic when I manually submit the form with proper React state. The issue is getting the form to submit.\n\nWait, I just had an idea. What if I use the browser's console to interact with the React form? I can use React DevTools-like approach to find the form component and trigger its submit.\n\nActually, let me try yet another approach. Let me:\n1. Navigate to the form\n2. Use the CDP protocol to dispatch a proper click event on the checkbox\n3. Or use JavaScript to trigger the checkbox's change event through the proper React event delegation\n\nReact 18 uses event delegation at the root. So click events bubble up to the root where React handles them. Let me dispatch a click event at the document level that targets the checkbox.\n\nActually, let me just try using CDP's Input.dispatchMouseEvent which is lower-level than Playwright's mouse.click.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"ca6c7034-2d73-4a13-8541-d522d88fcf2a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524010045e292027a39b84cb9","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_d4cc3fcf0f694e06bfd11f83","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/create_cdp.cjs << 'SCRIPT'\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.connectOverCDP('http://127.0.0.1:9222');\n  const context = browser.contexts()[0];\n  \n  // Monitor API calls\n  context.on('response', async res => {\n    const url = res.url();\n    if (res.request().method() === 'POST' && url.includes('open-douyin') && !url.includes('monitor') && !url.includes('collect') && !url.includes('channel') && !url.includes('tcc') && !url.includes('token') && !url.includes('checkFeelGood') && !url.includes('GetDict') && !url.includes('ValidUser') && !url.includes('checkUserHasApp') && !url.includes('enterOrder') && !url.includes('GetChange') && !url.includes('GetAnnouncement') && !url.includes('applicationList') && !url.includes('checkLife') && !url.includes('GetPrompt') && !url.includes('getIndustry') && !url.includes('getSubject') && !url.includes('getCompany') && !url.includes('canUseDemo')) {\n      try {\n        const body = await res.text();\n        console.log(`API: ${url.substring(url.indexOf('bff_api'))} -> ${body.substring(0, 300)}`);\n      } catch(e) {}\n    }\n  });\n  \n  const page = await context.newPage();\n  await page.goto('https://developer.open-douyin.com/console/apply/game', {\n    waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded', timeout: 30000\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(8000);\n  \n  // Fill inputs with type()\n  const inputs = page.locator('input[type=\"text\"]');\n  const vals = ['鼎诺成语闯关', '周鼎诺', '18108431035', '1163155015@qq.com'];\n  for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n    await inputs.nth(i).click();\n    await inputs.nth(i).fill('');\n    await inputs.nth(i).type(vals[i], { delay: 20 });\n  }\n  console.log('Inputs filled');\n  \n  // Select engine via #tech_type\n  await page.locator('#tech_type').click({ timeout: 10000 });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\n  // Click the first option that contains 普通小游戏引擎\n  const options = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-select-option');\n  const optCount = await options.count();\n  for (let i = 0; i < optCount; i++) {\n    const text = await options.nth(i).textContent();\n    if (text.includes('普通小游戏引擎')) {\n      await options.nth(i).click();\n      break;\n    }\n  }\n  console.log('Engine selected');\n  \n  // Checkbox: use CDP to dispatch mouse events\n  console.log('Checkbox...');\n  const cbInput = page.locator('input[type=\"checkbox\"]');\n  const cbBox = await cbInput.boundingBox();\n  console.log('Checkbox box:', cbBox);\n  \n  if (cbBox) {\n    // Use CDP to dispatch proper mouse events\n    const cdpSession = await context.newCDPSession(page);\n    \n    // Dispatch mousePressed and mouseReleased at checkbox position\n    const x = cbBox.x + cbBox.width / 2;\n    const y = cbBox.y + cbBox.height / 2;\n    \n    await cdpSession.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', {\n      type: 'mousePressed',\n      x: x,\n      y: y,\n      button: 'left',\n      clickCount: 1,\n    });\n    \n    await page.waitForTimeout(50);\n    \n    await cdpSession.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', {\n      type: 'mouseReleased',\n      x: x,\n      y: y,\n      button: 'left',\n      clickCount: 1,\n    });\n    \n    console.log('CDP click dispatched');\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  let checked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n  console.log('Checked after CDP:', checked);\n  \n  // If still not checked, click the checkbox's visible inner element\n  if (!checked) {\n    console.log('Clicking inner display...');\n    const inner = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-checkbox-inner').first();\n    const innerBox = await inner.boundingBox();\n    if (innerBox) {\n      const cdpSession2 = await context.newCDPSession(page);\n      await cdpSession2.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', {\n        type: 'mousePressed', x: innerBox.x + innerBox.width/2, y: innerBox.y + innerBox.height/2, button: 'left', clickCount: 1,\n      });\n      await page.waitForTimeout(50);\n      await cdpSession2.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', {\n        type: 'mouseReleased', x: innerBox.x + innerBox.width/2, y: innerBox.y + innerBox.height/2, button: 'left', clickCount: 1,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n    checked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n    console.log('Checked after inner CDP:', checked);\n  }\n  \n  // One last resort: trigger via React props with proper event simulation\n  if (!checked) {\n    console.log('Last resort: React + native click simulation...');\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const input = document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]');\n      // Trigger the native click event that Semi Design listens to\n      const nativeClick = new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, view: window });\n      input.dispatchEvent(nativeClick);\n      \n      // Also trigger on the wrapper\n      const wrapper = document.querySelector('.semi-dy-open-checkbox');\n      if (wrapper) {\n        wrapper.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, view: window }));\n        wrapper.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent('pointerdown', { bubbles: true, cancelable: true }));\n        wrapper.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent('pointerup', { bubbles: true, cancelable: true }));\n      }\n    });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n    checked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n    console.log('After native events:', checked);\n  }\n  \n  console.log('Final checkbox state:', checked);\n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/checkbox_state.png', fullPage: true });\n  \n  // Submit\n  console.log('Submitting...');\n  const btns = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button')).map(b => ({\n      text: b.textContent.trim(), rect: b.getBoundingClientRect(), disabled: b.disabled\n    }));\n  });\n  const submit = btns.find(b => b.text === '创建');\n  if (submit) {\n    const cdpSession3 = await context.newCDPSession(page);\n    await cdpSession3.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', {\n      type: 'mousePressed', x: submit.rect.x + submit.rect.width/2, y: submit.rect.y + submit.rect.height/2, button: 'left', clickCount: 1,\n    });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(50);\n    await cdpSession3.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', {\n      type: 'mouseReleased', x: submit.rect.x + submit.rect.width/2, y: submit.rect.y + submit.rect.height/2, button: 'left', clickCount: 1,\n    });\n    console.log('Submit clicked');\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(15000);\n  \n  console.log('URL:', page.url());\n  const text = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 3000));\n  console.log(text.substring(0, 800));\n  \n  const appIdMatch = text.match(/tte[a-z0-9]{10,}/);\n  if (appIdMatch) console.log('\\n*** APPID:', appIdMatch[0], '***');\n  \n  await browser.close();\n})();\nSCRIPT\nNODE_PATH=\"C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Roaming/npm/node_modules\" node /tmp/create_cdp.cjs 2>&1","description":"Create game using CDP mouse events for checkbox","timeout":180000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"ae345e08-028e-4b11-9833-e5c297ad4ad9"}
