{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_d4cc3fcf0f694e06bfd11f83","type":"tool_result","content":"API: https://developer.open-douyin.com/ttwid/check/ -> {\"message\":\"check pass\",\"sub_status_code\":2001,\"status_code\":0}\nInputs filled\nEngine selected\nCheckbox...\nCheckbox box: { x: 698, y: 825, width: 16, height: 20 }\nCDP click dispatched\nChecked after CDP: false\nClicking inner display...\nChecked after inner CDP: true\nFinal checkbox state: true\nSubmitting...\nSubmit clicked\nURL: https://developer.open-douyin.com/console/apply/game\n应用开发\n能力直达\n文档站\n学堂与社区\n开发者支持\n服务生态\n控制台\n2\nuunderli...\n控制台\n创建小游戏\n小游戏名称\n1. 名称支持大小写字母、数字和中文，字符长度4-30，一个汉字算两个字符\n2. 建议小游戏名称和软著等资质文件等级名称保持一致，否则可能无法进行备案、广告投放等。查看详细命名规则。\n联系人姓名\n联系人电话\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n联系人邮箱\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n小游戏预计使用开发引擎\nUnity引擎\n请选择该款小游戏预计使用的开发引擎，后续开发时可随时更改「引擎切换指引」\n我已阅读并同意\n《小游戏开发者平台服务协议》\n、\n《小游戏开发者平台信息保护声明》\n创建\n更多说明\n关于修改\n\n1.\n\n \n\n正式上架前，名称可保留 30 天，如未及时发布版本，名称会被释放。（释放名称其他用户可抢占）\n\n2. 正式上架后，每个自然年可修改 2 次。\n\n关于审核\n\n1.\n\n \n\n名称仅支持使用中文、数字、及英文，不能使用特殊符号、繁体字、生僻字、拆字或颜文字；\n\n2.\n\n \n\n名称不可使用单个名词，如：摩托、恐龙等；不可使用通用游戏名称类，如：斗地主、麻将等；\n\n3.\n\n \n\n名称的信息表达和小游戏内容必须具有一致性；\n\n4.\n\n \n\n名称不得混有商业化用语、热门应用名称、不可侵犯他人知识产权 (如今日头条、抖音等)；\n\n5.\n\n \n\n1～2 个工作日内可完成审核\n\n查看审核细则\n确认创建\n引擎类别将影响该游戏后续可使用的开发工具，创建后无法跨类别修改，请确认是否创建\"Unity引擎\"类型？\n\nUnity引擎开发工具：查看介绍文档\nCocos/Laya/Egret/Godot引擎开发工具：查看介绍文档\n取消\n确认创建","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"4e2eeeb8-7c2d-4a98-9180-c509b715219a","timestamp":"2026-05-23T17:01:48.167Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"API: https://developer.open-douyin.com/ttwid/check/ -> {\"message\":\"check pass\",\"sub_status_code\":2001,\"status_code\":0}\nInputs filled\nEngine selected\nCheckbox...\nCheckbox box: { x: 698, y: 825, width: 16, height: 20 }\nCDP click dispatched\nChecked after CDP: false\nClicking inner display...\nChecked after inner CDP: true\nFinal checkbox state: true\nSubmitting...\nSubmit clicked\nURL: https://developer.open-douyin.com/console/apply/game\n应用开发\n能力直达\n文档站\n学堂与社区\n开发者支持\n服务生态\n控制台\n2\nuunderli...\n控制台\n创建小游戏\n小游戏名称\n1. 名称支持大小写字母、数字和中文，字符长度4-30，一个汉字算两个字符\n2. 建议小游戏名称和软著等资质文件等级名称保持一致，否则可能无法进行备案、广告投放等。查看详细命名规则。\n联系人姓名\n联系人电话\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n联系人邮箱\n平台可能会通过该方式联系你，请填写有效的联系方式\n小游戏预计使用开发引擎\nUnity引擎\n请选择该款小游戏预计使用的开发引擎，后续开发时可随时更改「引擎切换指引」\n我已阅读并同意\n《小游戏开发者平台服务协议》\n、\n《小游戏开发者平台信息保护声明》\n创建\n更多说明\n关于修改\n\n1.\n\n \n\n正式上架前，名称可保留 30 天，如未及时发布版本，名称会被释放。（释放名称其他用户可抢占）\n\n2. 正式上架后，每个自然年可修改 2 次。\n\n关于审核\n\n1.\n\n \n\n名称仅支持使用中文、数字、及英文，不能使用特殊符号、繁体字、生僻字、拆字或颜文字；\n\n2.\n\n \n\n名称不可使用单个名词，如：摩托、恐龙等；不可使用通用游戏名称类，如：斗地主、麻将等；\n\n3.\n\n \n\n名称的信息表达和小游戏内容必须具有一致性；\n\n4.\n\n \n\n名称不得混有商业化用语、热门应用名称、不可侵犯他人知识产权 (如今日头条、抖音等)；\n\n5.\n\n \n\n1～2 个工作日内可完成审核\n\n查看审核细则\n确认创建\n引擎类别将影响该游戏后续可使用的开发工具，创建后无法跨类别修改，请确认是否创建\"Unity引擎\"类型？\n\nUnity引擎开发工具：查看介绍文档\nCocos/Laya/Egret/Godot引擎开发工具：查看介绍文档\n取消\n确认创建","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240101507acc360e03d74fdc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I can see a confirmation dialog! The form submission actually triggered a confirmation modal that says:\n```\n确认创建引擎类别将影响该游戏后续可使用的开发工具，创建后无法跨类别修改，请确认是否创建\"Unity引擎\"类型？Unity引擎开发工具：查看介绍文档Cocos/Laya/Egret/Godot引擎开发工具：查看介绍文档取消确认创建\n```\nThe issue is that it selected \"Unity引擎\" instead of \"普通小游戏引擎\". The engine selection went wrong. And there's a confirmation dialog asking \"确认创建\" (Confirm Create).\n\nSo the form DID submit! But:\n1. The engine was set to \"Unity引擎\" instead of \"普通小游戏引擎\"\n2. A confirmation dialog appeared asking me to confirm\n\nI need to:\n1. Cancel this dialog (because the engine is wrong)\n2. Fix the engine selection to \"普通小游戏引擎\"\n3. Submit again\n4. Confirm the creation\n\nBut first, let me just confirm this creation with Unity引擎 - we can change the engine later if needed. Or better, let me cancel, fix the engine, and try again.\n\nActually wait - the dialog says \"创建后无法跨类别修改\" (cannot change category after creation). So the engine type matters and I should fix it.\n\nLet me cancel the dialog and try again with the correct engine.\n\nBut wait, the engine issue is interesting. When I clicked \"普通小游戏引擎\" option, it actually selected \"Unity引擎\". This might be because there are multiple option lists (from different dropdowns), and the `.semi-dy-open-select-option` selector matched the wrong one.\n\nLet me try:\n1. Cancel the dialog\n2. Re-select the engine properly\n3. Submit again\n4. Confirm","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"c882e822-7928-4d80-b909-f2a873648c75"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240101507acc360e03d74fdc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"出现确认对话框 - 引擎选择错误（Unity 而不是普通引擎）。让我来修复它。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"98f561ad-bdb3-498e-8f30-78020dc7c6be"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240101507acc360e03d74fdc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_f8e9daa03aa34940987faf3b","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/create_confirm.cjs << 'SCRIPT'\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.connectOverCDP('http://127.0.0.1:9222');\n  const context = browser.contexts()[0];\n  \n  context.on('response', async res => {\n    const url = res.url();\n    if (res.request().method() === 'POST' && url.includes('bff_api') && !url.includes('monitor') && !url.includes('collect') && !url.includes('channel') && !url.includes('tcc') && !url.includes('token') && !url.includes('checkFeelGood') && !url.includes('GetDict') && !url.includes('ValidUser') && !url.includes('checkUser') && !url.includes('enterOrder') && !url.includes('GetChange') && !url.includes('GetAnnounce') && !url.includes('applicationList') && !url.includes('checkLife') && !url.includes('GetPrompt') && !url.includes('getIndustry') && !url.includes('getSubject') && !url.includes('getCompany') && !url.includes('canUseDemo') && !url.includes('JudgeAi') && !url.includes('getGameVersion') && !url.includes('getPosts') && !url.includes('getFeel') && !url.includes('Announcement')) {\n      try {\n        const body = await res.text();\n        console.log(`API: ${url.substring(url.indexOf('bff_api'))} -> ${body.substring(0, 300)}`);\n      } catch(e) {}\n    }\n  });\n  \n  // Find the page with the confirmation dialog\n  const pages = context.pages();\n  let page = pages.find(p => p.url().includes('console/apply/game'));\n  if (!page) {\n    console.log('No form page found');\n    await browser.close();\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  // Cancel the current dialog\n  console.log('Canceling current dialog...');\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('button');\n    for (const b of btns) {\n      if (b.textContent.trim() === '取消') { b.click(); return; }\n    }\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\n  console.log('Dialog canceled');\n  \n  // Now fix the engine - open dropdown and select correctly\n  console.log('Re-selecting engine...');\n  \n  // Click the tech_type dropdown\n  await page.locator('#tech_type').click({ timeout: 10000 });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\n  \n  // List all visible options\n  const optionTexts = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    // Get all option elements in the dropdown popup\n    const popup = document.querySelector('.semi-dy-open-select-option-list, [role=\"listbox\"]');\n    if (popup) {\n      return Array.from(popup.querySelectorAll('[role=\"option\"], .semi-dy-open-select-option')).map(o => ({\n        text: o.textContent.trim(),\n        id: o.id,\n        idx: o.getAttribute('data-key') || o.getAttribute('aria-posinset'),\n      }));\n    }\n    // Fallback: get all visible options\n    return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-select-option')).map((o, i) => ({\n      text: o.textContent.trim(),\n      id: o.id,\n      idx: i,\n      visible: o.offsetParent !== null,\n    }));\n  });\n  console.log('Options:', JSON.stringify(optionTexts));\n  \n  // Select \"普通小游戏引擎(Cocos/Laya/Egret/Godot/其他)\"\n  // Find the option that's visible and contains \"普通小游戏引擎\"\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\n    // Get the dropdown popup's options\n    const options = document.querySelectorAll('[role=\"option\"], .semi-dy-open-select-option');\n    for (const opt of options) {\n      if (opt.textContent.includes('普通小游戏引擎') && opt.offsetParent !== null) {\n        opt.click();\n        return;\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n  \n  // Verify engine selection\n  const engineValue = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const trigger = document.querySelector('#tech_type');\n    return trigger?.textContent?.trim();\n  });\n  console.log('Selected engine:', engineValue);\n  \n  // If still wrong, try clicking by index\n  if (engineValue?.includes('Unity')) {\n    console.log('Still Unity, trying by index...');\n    await page.locator('#tech_type').click({ timeout: 10000 });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\n    \n    // Click the first option\n    const firstOpt = page.locator('[role=\"option\"]').first();\n    await firstOpt.click({ timeout: 5000 });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n    \n    const val2 = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('#tech_type')?.textContent?.trim());\n    console.log('After first option click:', val2);\n  }\n  \n  // Re-check checkbox (may have been unchecked by cancel)\n  const isChecked = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked);\n  console.log('Checkbox:', isChecked);\n  \n  if (!isChecked) {\n    // Click inner checkbox\n    const inner = page.locator('.semi-dy-open-checkbox-inner').first();\n    const innerBox = await inner.boundingBox();\n    if (innerBox) {\n      const cdp = await context.newCDPSession(page);\n      await cdp.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', { type: 'mousePressed', x: innerBox.x + innerBox.width/2, y: innerBox.y + innerBox.height/2, button: 'left', clickCount: 1 });\n      await page.waitForTimeout(50);\n      await cdp.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', { type: 'mouseReleased', x: innerBox.x + innerBox.width/2, y: innerBox.y + innerBox.height/2, button: 'left', clickCount: 1 });\n    }\n    await page.waitForTimeout(300);\n    console.log('Checkbox re-checked:', await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector('input[type=\"checkbox\"]')?.checked));\n  }\n  \n  // Submit again\n  console.log('Submitting...');\n  const submitBtn = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('button');\n    for (const b of btns) {\n      if (b.textContent.trim() === '创建' && !b.disabled) {\n        const rect = b.getBoundingClientRect();\n        return { x: rect.x + rect.width/2, y: rect.y + rect.height/2 };\n      }\n    }\n    return null;\n  });\n  \n  if (submitBtn) {\n    const cdp2 = await context.newCDPSession(page);\n    await cdp2.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', { type: 'mousePressed', x: submitBtn.x, y: submitBtn.y, button: 'left', clickCount: 1 });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(50);\n    await cdp2.send('Input.dispatchMouseEvent', { type: 'mouseReleased', x: submitBtn.x, y: submitBtn.y, button: 'left', clickCount: 1 });\n    console.log('Submitted');\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(5000);\n  \n  // Now look for the confirmation dialog\n  const dialogText = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 3000));\n  console.log('After submit:', dialogText.substring(dialogText.indexOf('确认创建') !== -1 ? dialogText.indexOf('确认创建') - 100 : dialogText.length - 500, dialogText.indexOf('确认创建') !== -1 ? dialogText.indexOf('确认创建') + 300 : dialogText.length));\n  \n  // If confirmation dialog appeared, click \"确认创建\"\n  const hasConfirm = dialogText.includes('确认创建');\n  console.log('Has confirmation:', hasConfirm);\n  \n  if (hasConfirm) {\n    // Check what engine type is shown\n    const isUnity = dialogText.includes('Unity');\n    console.log('Engine in dialog is Unity:', isUnity);\n    \n    if (isUnity) {\n      console.log('WRONG ENGINE - canceling');\n      await page.evaluate(() => {\n        const btns = document.querySelectorAll('button');\n        for (const b of btns) {\n          if (b.textContent.trim() === '取消') { b.click(); return; }\n        }\n      });\n    } else {\n      console.log('Correct engine! Confirming...');\n      await page.evaluate(() => {\n        const btns = document.querySelectorAll('button');\n        for (const b of btns) {\n          if (b.textContent.trim() === '确认创建') { b.click(); return; }\n        }\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  \n  await page.waitForTimeout(15000);\n  \n  console.log('\\nFinal URL:', page.url());\n  const finalText = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 3000));\n  console.log(finalText.substring(0, 800));\n  \n  const appIdMatch = finalText.match(/tte[a-z0-9]{10,}/);\n  if (appIdMatch) console.log('\\n*** APPID:', appIdMatch[0], '***');\n  \n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'C:/tmp/final_result2.png', fullPage: true });\n  await browser.close();\n})();\nSCRIPT\nNODE_PATH=\"C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Roaming/npm/node_modules\" node /tmp/create_confirm.cjs 2>&1","description":"Cancel dialog, fix engine, and resubmit","timeout":180000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"8ee0b055-74d5-4d1b-9824-82b52ea84204"}
