 Some other config issue\n3. The project structure doesn't matchLet me try changing compileType to \"miniapp\" to see if it works. The workflow said the previous AppID (tte...) needed \"miniapp\", so maybe this new AppID (tta...) needs something else.\n\nActually, looking at the API response from the game creation:\n```json{\"data\":{\"AppId\":\"tta020d69d3e47b4f607\",...}}```\n\nThe response used `AppId` (capital A, capital I), not `appId`. And the AppID starts with `tta` not `tte`. This might be a different type of ID that requires a different compileType.\n\nLet me try `compileType: \"miniapp\"` since `tte` required `miniapp`, and `tta` might too. Actually wait, the previous game (消消消大作战) was originally created as a \"game\" type too, but its AppID was `tte...` and required `compileType: \"miniapp\"`. So maybe ALL games require `compileType: \"miniapp\"` on this platform.Let me try changing to \"miniapp\".","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"3e8e51ae-6ea8-45d4-9f46-d312f4f00149"}
