{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524011701c1b8c526fc8540a8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see a different, more informative error:\n> 当前项目为小玩法项目，但是 \"tta020d69d3e47b4f607\" 属于小程序 ID。\n> Translation: \"Current project is a mini-game project, but tta020d69d3e47b4f607 is a mini-program ID.\"\n\nSo the AppID `tta020d69d3e47b4f607` is actually a mini-program (小程序) ID, not a mini-game (小游戏) ID. The `compileType: \"game\"` means it's detected as a game project, but the AppID is for mini-programs.\n\nThis is the same issue as before - the AppID type must match the project type. The error says:\n- Project type: game (小玩法 = mini-game, because of game.js + game.json)\n- AppID type: mini-program (小程序, because tta prefix)\n\nSo I need to either:\n1. Change compileType to \"miniapp\" and use app.js + app.json (mini-program format)\n2. Or create a new game with the correct AppID type\n\nLet me try option 1: use miniapp format.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f456d29-d84c-44e0-89e7-7ad362d1b1bb","uuid":"d4b86ade-0050-4528-9a05-da4fd15916fe"}
